            "review_title": "Review at Tiệm Lẩu 1996",
            "review_text": "Quang Canh\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n2\nExperience Authentic Vietnamese Hotpot at Tiệm Lẩu 1996!\nOct 2024 • Family\nIf you want to taste true Vietnamese flavors, Tiệm Lẩu 1996 is the place! Our specialty, Lẩu mắm (fermented fish hotpot), is a must-try for those looking for something unique and delicious. The rich, savory broth is made from traditional recipes, served with fresh vegetables, seafood, and meats to create the perfect balance of flavors. Come visit us at Tiệm Lẩu 1996 for an unforgettable taste of Vietnam!\nRead more\nWritten October 28, 2024",
